## Design Coherence
The implementation strictly follows the decision to use a custom `useMachine` hook and pure reducers with discriminated unions. The code is highly type-safe and predictable.

## Findings

### SUGGESTION
In `LoginPage.tsx` and `SignupPage.tsx`, the submit button is only disabled when `state.type === 'SUBMITTING'`. While Zod validation is synchronous and fast, it is better practice to also disable the button during the `VALIDATING` state for consistency.

